From: Jayanth Othayoth <ojayanth@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 02:17:43 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 11/12] amd-event-log: add runtime AFID integration

Add runtime helper APIs on top of the generated AFID
lookup database.

The implementation provides support for resolving AFID
metadata from event messages and associated AdditionalData.
The runtime layer converts event data into structures that
can be consumed by AEL extensions without requiring direct
access to the generated lookup database.

Also add common helper utilities and unit tests covering
AFID resolution and AdditionalData parsing behavior.

This change introduces runtime integration support only.
AMD Redfish payload projection and OEM metadata rendering
are added in subsequent changes.

Change-Id: I1b873dba21ed234247d711107842c918dd1b9954
Signed-off-by: Jayanth Othayoth <ojayanth@gmail.com>
